sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Main UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant STT as Speech-to-Text
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Tool as Task Tools
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>UI: Say "Mark backend task as completed"
    UI->>API: POST /agent/voice with audio
    API->>STT: transcribe audio
    STT-->>API: "Mark backend task as completed"
    API->>Graph: tenant_id + transcript
    Graph->>Tool: query candidate tasks
    Tool->>DB: select tasks where tenant_id and status pending
    DB-->>Tool: candidate tasks
    Tool-->>Graph: best match
    Graph->>Tool: complete_task(tenant_id, task_id)
    Tool->>DB: update tasks set status completed
    Tool->>DB: insert into task_logs
    Tool-->>Graph: completion result
    Graph-->>API: response + updated task
    API-->>UI: JSON response
    UI-->>User: Show completed status
